{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And I admonished them on the day they sold food</b> — the correct reading is ואעיד בם."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {0 "The comment argues that the phrase ואעיד ביום מכרם ציד in the verse should read instead ואעיד בם; the cryptic brevity leaves the basis for this reading unexplained."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:43.327735507Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}